' Two humans from the start screen, played through without a break: the
' reference run for two_humans_part.script + two_humans_resume.script.
' Run with `menu seed 7 start 0 start2 1 savefile <f>`: player 0 in New
' Sandez, player 1 in Sana (fixed starts are a test tool; a game from
' the screen draws them). Seats 2 and 3 are Classic's computer players.
menuclick 160,100        ' the intro: a click goes to the start screen (IntroScene.cs:135-139)
menuclick 161,165        ' MODE: Extended -> Original
menuclick 60,104         ' player one's slot
type Anna
menuclick 250,104        ' player two's slot
type Bob
menuclick 163,54         ' START
wait 3
' Day 1, player 0 (Anna), New Sandez: acts in the location.
clock 60000              ' 60 of the day's 240 seconds
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
clickon 248              ' a mercenary
hire                     ' the offer closes on taking it: she stays inside
wait 20
day                      ' NEXT: player 1 plays, on the same clock
' Day 1, player 1 (Bob), Sana.
clock 30000              ' 30 more of the same day: 150 left
save                     ' the cut, written here too so both runs pass the same steps
mapclick 61,355          ' Bob sets out for Bearwoods; setting out ends his turn
' Day 2: Anna, a full clock, still inside New Sandez; Bob is on the road.
clock 20000
day
' Day 3: Anna again; the day's end brings Bob in.
day
' Day 4: Anna, then Bob, who has arrived.
day
clock 40000              ' 40 s of Bob's day-4 turn: 200 left
save                     ' the second cut, on a later day than a new process starts on
mapclick 61,355          ' Bob walks into Bearwoods
wait 20
day
save
